
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

    <title>트리플에스 커뮤니티- 내 정보 수정</title>
</head>

<body class="other-page">
{{>layout/header}}

<form method="post" action="/mypage_edit">
    이메일: <input type="text" name="email" value="{{member.email}}"><br>
    주소: <input type="text" name="address" value="{{member.address}}"><br>
    비밀번호 변경 (선택): <input type="password" name="password"><br>
    <button type="submit">수정</button>

    <button onclick="history.back()" class="btn btn-secondary mt-2">뒤로가기</button>
</form>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-MrcW6ZMFYlzcLA8Nl+NtUVF0sA7MsXsP1UyJoMp4YLEuNSfAP+JcXn/tWtIaxVXM" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>
</html>